{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "SLOWLY FIGHTER",
    "steam_appid": 3397480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=====================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and videotaping gameplay and monetizing them are all OK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >======================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a master of martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your sharpened senses, everything seems to happen in slow motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no Life gauge. A master's attacks hit vital points precisely, so a single hit result in an instant KO. Dodge the enemy's attack and deliver a fatal blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Single Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time is Reiwa. A martial arts tournament to determine the true strongest is being held...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six masters take to the battlefield with their own thoughts in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the end of the story and become a witness to history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Local 2P Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a match between a friend and a master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Online 2P Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite master and jump into battle with the whole world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also participate with an edited character and show off your favorite outfit! Show off your battle sense and visual sense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Avatar Creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Create your own avatar by customizing your name, body shape, hairstyle, facial expression, voice, accessories, pose, and dialogue!]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set up your avatar's facial expression and body shape with sliders, and even change the attack voice to your own voice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also change the attack voice to your own voice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Online Gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upload your avatar to the online gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uploaded avatars can be viewed by players all over the world at any time,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find one you like, you can download it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Streamer Config</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online matches, you can expect to play with a variety of custom characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch the display of each item from \u201cDistributor Settings\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbName display = Display character's name, school, and hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAppearance = Character's appearance, clothing and accessories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCharacter's dialogue = Character's dialogue is displayed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCharacter's voice = Playback of character's voice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=====================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and videotaping gameplay and monetizing them are all OK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >======================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a master of martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your sharpened senses, everything seems to happen in slow motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no Life gauge. A master's attacks hit vital points precisely, so a single hit result in an instant KO. Dodge the enemy's attack and deliver a fatal blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Single Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time is Reiwa. A martial arts tournament to determine the true strongest is being held...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six masters take to the battlefield with their own thoughts in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the end of the story and become a witness to history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Local 2P Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a match between a friend and a master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Online 2P Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite master and jump into battle with the whole world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also participate with an edited character and show off your favorite outfit! Show off your battle sense and visual sense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Avatar Creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Create your own avatar by customizing your name, body shape, hairstyle, facial expression, voice, accessories, pose, and dialogue!]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set up your avatar's facial expression and body shape with sliders, and even change the attack voice to your own voice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also change the attack voice to your own voice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Online Gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upload your avatar to the online gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uploaded avatars can be viewed by players all over the world at any time,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find one you like, you can download it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Streamer Config</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online matches, you can expect to play with a variety of custom characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch the display of each item from \u201cDistributor Settings\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbName display = Display character's name, school, and hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAppearance = Character's appearance, clothing and accessories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCharacter's dialogue = Character's dialogue is displayed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCharacter's voice = Playback of character's voice.</p>",
